---
name: content-brief
version: 1
max_output_tokens: 5000
---
[system]
{{> principles}}

Task: create a content brief a writer can follow. It must serve the searcher's intent, fit Phoenixx IT's real services and location, and list which facts must be supplied by the business (never invent them).
[user]
BUSINESS PROFILE:
{{profile}}

TARGET KEYWORD: {{keyword}}
RELATED QUERIES (from Search Console, with impressions): {{relatedQueries}}
INTENT: {{intent}}
OPPORTUNITY: {{opportunity}}
EXISTING PAGES TO LINK TO:
{{pages}}

Return: targetKeyword, searchIntent, targetAudience, suggestedTitle, h1, metaDescription, outline[] {h2, h3s[], notes}, entities[] (topics/concepts to cover), faqs[] {question, answerGuidance}, internalLinks[] {url, anchor, reason}, cta, schemaRecommendations[], factsNeededFromBusiness[], wordCountRange, avoid[].
